    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00297",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“是美代吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is that Miyo?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00297",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我怎么啦……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What is wrong with me...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00297",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不论早晚，也不论午餐晚饭，我都是生活在梦幻之中。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Whether morning or evening, whether lunch or dinner, I am always living inside a dream.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00297",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "啊，你们让我吃什么我就吃什么，这种照顾我受够了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, I eat whatever you make me eat; I have had enough of being cared for like this...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00297",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "前些日子，我听了神佛的话，总是念念不忘啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Some days ago, I heard the words of the gods and Buddhas, and I cannot stop thinking of them.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00297",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "难道我是被神佛抛弃了吗！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Could it be that I have been abandoned by the gods and Buddhas?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
